1
00:02:31,067 --> 00:02:41,067
All pirates searching for the treasure One Piece must brave the second half of the Grand Line.

2
00:02:41,067 --> 00:02:45,067
These wild and dangerous seas are known as the New World.

3
00:02:45,067 --> 00:02:52,067
Gold Roger and his crew were the only men to ever chart these waters and learn all the secrets they held.

4
00:02:52,067 --> 00:02:59,067
For the rest of the pirates of the world, this has proven to be the end of the road, a graveyard of dreams.

5
00:02:59,067 --> 00:03:09,067
Now, Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body became rubber after eating the gum gum fruit, sets sail into the New World with his faithful crew.

6
00:03:09,067 --> 00:03:13,067
I'm gonna be the king of the pirates!

7
00:03:16,067 --> 00:03:25,067
Two years have passed since the War of the Best in Marineford. Reuniting after this special training, Luffy and his crew continue on to the New World.

8
00:03:25,067 --> 00:03:32,067
Their first stop is Fishman Island, thousands of feet below sea level, where trouble seems to find them wherever they go.

9
00:03:32,067 --> 00:03:37,067
The Fishman Pirates, led by Hordy Jones, plot to overthrow King Neptune and rule the kingdom.

10
00:03:37,067 --> 00:03:42,067
They have teamed up with Vander Decken, who has eyes on the Mermaid Princess.

11
00:03:42,067 --> 00:03:46,067
The Straw Hat Pirates are now entrenched in the conflict.

12
