Meanwhile, at the palace, Zorro and the others wage battle with Hordy after his new Fishman Pirates launched a plan to sneak inside.

22
00:04:33,067 --> 00:04:37,067
Your hero is at an end! The miserable, worthless primate!

23
00:04:38,067 --> 00:04:39,067
Ah!

24
