Ow!

39
00:05:27,067 --> 00:05:28,067
Ow!

40
00:05:28,067 --> 00:05:29,067
Ow!

41
00:05:29,067 --> 00:05:32,067
Ow!

42
00:05:32,067 --> 00:05:33,067
Ow!

43
