94
00:08:16,067 --> 00:08:17,067
Zorro, swim faster!

95
00:08:17,067 --> 00:08:19,067
We gotta get out of here!

96
00:08:19,067 --> 00:08:22,067
I only hope that my back doesn't give out when I need it most.

97
00:08:35,067 --> 00:08:37,067
Ready yourselves, my soldiers.

98
00:08:37,067 --> 00:08:39,067
I shall create a path for you.

99
00:08:40,067 --> 00:08:42,067
We shall retreat to fight another day!

100
00:08:43,067 --> 00:08:44,067
