101
00:08:46,067 --> 00:08:47,067
Combat!

102
00:08:50,067 --> 00:08:51,067
Take this!

103
00:08:51,067 --> 00:08:52,067
You're gonna need it!

104
00:08:52,067 --> 00:08:53,067
Here we go!

105
00:08:59,067 --> 00:09:00,067
Neptune's up to something!

106
00:09:00,067 --> 00:09:01,067
Get ready!

107
00:09:01,067 --> 00:09:02,067
Zorro!

108
00:09:02,067 --> 00:09:12,067
Ultra Marine!

109
00:09:12,067 --> 00:09:13,067
Ha!

110
00:09:19,067 --> 00:09:21,067
All soldiers forward!

111
