Vander Decken's relentless pursuit began right after the death of the Queen.

281
00:19:45,267 --> 00:19:48,267
Shirahoshi was denied any chance at closure.

282
00:19:48,267 --> 00:19:53,267
And even worse, she was unable to attend her mother's funeral.

283
00:19:53,267 --> 00:19:57,267
She spent every day since locked in the hardshell tower.

284
